{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471878",
      "title": "Adding Entry Animations",
      "sourceHash": "ba55bb41a43cb057d6aba8a8a8c10f9af4d3885f1513d9a8ceddefa95027300c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 1.77,
          "en": "As a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.77,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "I also wanna migrate this entry animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "of this modal here from just CSS to Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "And I wanna do this for two reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "The first reason, again, is the look and feel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "It's definitely fine for this animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 21.9,
          "en": "and just because of the look and feel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.9,
          "end": 24.51,
          "en": "we probably should not switch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 28.44,
          "en": "But I then also wanna make sure, as a second step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 31.863,
          "en": "that we can animate the disappearance of that modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 34.71,
          "en": "And for that, let's first make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.71,
          "end": 36.513,
          "en": "that we animate its appearance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 41.28,
          "en": "To do that, we should go to this modal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.28,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "And there we want to animate the dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.58,
          "end": 47.283,
          "en": "that holds this modal content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "Now, as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 53.1,
          "en": "I'll actually go to the index CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 56.16,
          "en": "And there I'll get rid of this animation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.16,
          "end": 59.103,
          "en": "I'll not use vanilla CSS anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 62.94,
          "en": "But with that back in modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.94,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "this dialogue should now be animated with Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.44,
          "end": 68.273,
          "en": "To achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.273,
          "end": 72.66,
          "en": "we again must import motion from Framer Motion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.66,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "as we did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "And then here, instead of using the standard dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.01,
          "en": "I wanna use the motion dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.01,
          "end": 83.613,
          "en": "so that this element can be animated with Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "Then as a next step, as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 90.3,
          "en": "we can add the animate prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.3,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "to define the value we want to animate to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 95.613,
          "en": "But here's something tricky now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.50999999999999,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "Inside of this modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 102.69,
          "en": "this dialogue will always be part of the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.69,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "and there won't be any props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 109.68,
          "en": "or any state that would change inside of this component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "that would tell us that this modal did now appear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 118.62,
          "en": "So animating to a different value will be tricky here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.62,
          "end": 120.36,
          "en": "because we got no indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.36,
          "end": 122.73,
          "en": "for whether this modal was just added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.73,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "or if it's been visible for a minute now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "So unlike in challenge-item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 131.46,
          "en": "where we had this isExpanded prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.46,
          "end": 134.76,
          "en": "that could be used to switch between different values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.76,
          "end": 137.553,
          "en": "We have no such prop or state in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.57,
          "end": 142.47,
          "en": "But we also don't need it, because these motion components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.47,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "also give us access to another pretty useful prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "that we can set on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 151.14,
          "en": "We can set the initial prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.14,
          "end": 156.14,
          "en": "and this initial prop allows us to define an initial state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 160.11,
          "en": "for the to-be-performed animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.11,
          "end": 162.75,
          "en": "that will be assumed immediately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.75,
          "end": 165.84,
          "en": "after this element has been added to the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.84,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "So initial allows us to set the starting state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 171.063,
          "en": "of this element, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.11,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "And if that state then deviates from the animate state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 179.85,
          "en": "Framer Motion will automatically play that animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.85,
          "end": 183.54,
          "en": "to get to that target animate state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.54,
          "end": 186.36,
          "en": "So therefore, here, in initial,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.36,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "we can set the opacity to zero, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 195.003,
          "en": "to make it invisible initially when it occurs in the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 199.95,
          "en": "and set the y value to minus 30",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.95,
          "end": 203.343,
          "en": "to push it down by 30 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.39,
          "end": 207.6,
          "en": "And then in animate, I wanna set the opacity to 1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.6,
          "end": 211.14,
          "en": "so that will be the target value for the opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.14,
          "end": 215.043,
          "en": "and y to 0, so that it's not pushed down anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 218.73,
          "en": "And that's how we can use initial and animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.73,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "to play an initial animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 225.09,
          "en": "from these values to these values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.09,
          "end": 227.55,
          "en": "And that's there for already all again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 231.24,
          "en": "If we save that, and I click Add Challenge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 233.01,
          "en": "it's coming down from the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.01,
          "end": 235.65,
          "en": "because of course this should be a positive number here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.65,
          "end": 237.48,
          "en": "to push it down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 241.11,
          "en": "So this must be plus 30, not minus 30.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.11,
          "end": 244.17,
          "en": "But with that, again, if I click Add Challenge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 244.17,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "this is now coming up from the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 248.85,
          "en": "And it also has a slight bounce effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.85,
          "end": 250.14,
          "en": "which you might see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.14,
          "end": 253.32,
          "en": "and therefore feels a bit more natural and snappy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.32,
          "end": 254.67,
          "en": "which is great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.67,
          "end": 257.61,
          "en": "But as a next step, let's now also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.61,
          "end": 260.43,
          "en": "that we can animate the disappearance of this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.43,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "because as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 266.283,
          "en": "that's not really possible with just CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}